 "remarks": "Family retreat with in ground pool and outdoor entertaining and cooking area is available for your summer getaway. Bike to the beach from this 4 bedroom 4 full bath cozy home with welcoming front porch, playroom and full bath on every level. Primary suite is private and features a full bath, and balcony for your morning coffee. Huge new deck off kitchen.  Three family bedrooms with full bath, open floorplan with updated kitchen, huge family room, breakfast area and charming front porch. Lower level has a playroom, full bath and walks out to a huge entertaining area with bar, outdoor kitchen, patio and leads to a sparkling in ground pool for your summer enjoyment. Summer rental furnished from May 1 through September 30. Many updates. Tenant may not use fireplace.",
